# MCP.md

Model Context Protocol servers bundled with the agentic-workflow plugin. Where the
config loads from differs per harness:

- **Claude Code:** `.mcp.json` at the **project root** (copied by bootstrap). Claude
  Code reads it natively; approve the servers on first use. Add project-specific
  servers directly to this file.
- **Cursor:** MCP config is **plugin-global** — it loads from the installed plugin, not
  from this project. Do not add a project-local `.cursor/mcp.json` expecting the plugin
  servers to merge with it. A read-only symlink is at `.cursor/agentic-workflow-mcp.json`
  for browsing.

| Location | Path |
|---|---|
| Claude Code (active) | `.mcp.json` at project root |
| Cursor plugin (active) | `~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/mcp.json` |
| Cursor in-repo (reference) | `.cursor/agentic-workflow-mcp.json` — symlink only |

## Servers

| Server | Purpose | Env required |
|---|---|---|
| `github` | GitHub API (issues, PRs, repos) via `@modelcontextprotocol/server-github` | `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` |

Set the token in your shell or harness MCP settings before using GitHub MCP tools.

Override the symlink source with `AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_MCP=/path/to/mcp.json` if needed.
